    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BederSNAKE \u2014 Puzzle Strategy with a Twist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fresh take on classic snake gameplay paired with strategic challenges! <strong>BederSNAKE</strong> is a minimalist, top-down logic puzzler where the snake\u2019s mouth sits on its tail\u2014so every move risks looping into a dead end and trapping you across 284 brain-teasing levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sokoban with a twist</strong> \u2013 your tail-mouth blocks routes yet unlocks them; planning around it is the whole challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty that scales</strong> \u2013 ten gentle tutorial stages ease you in before the real brain-benders hit (optional hints if you get stuck).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo progress carries over</strong> \u2013 clear the 20-level demo and pick up right where you left off in the full game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart a snake that can only bite the apple\u2014while its mouth is at the wrong end?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BederSNAKE \u2014 Puzzle Strategy with a Twist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fresh take on classic snake gameplay paired with strategic challenges! <strong>BederSNAKE</strong> is a minimalist, top-down logic puzzler where the snake\u2019s mouth sits on its tail\u2014so every move risks looping into a dead end and trapping you across 284 brain-teasing levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sokoban with a twist</strong> \u2013 your tail-mouth blocks routes yet unlocks them; planning around it is the whole challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty that scales</strong> \u2013 ten gentle tutorial stages ease you in before the real brain-benders hit (optional hints if you get stuck).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo progress carries over</strong> \u2013 clear the 20-level demo and pick up right where you left off in the full game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart a snake that can only bite the apple\u2014while its mouth is at the wrong end?</p>",
    "short_description": "Guide a snake whose mouth is on its tail through 284 increasingly tricky Sokoban-style puzzles, looping, growing and outwitting yourself in a minimalist top-down logic challenge.",
